type: software
title: "Professional Python GUI Development Manual (MAN-PYQT6-001)"
abstract: >-
  Teaching manual on developing desktop applications with Python and PyQt6, from zero to
  advanced, in English and Brazilian Portuguese (fully localized editions with the same
  structure), with 169 run-and-verified listings per edition, a tested and packaged capstone
  project, and the document generator.
